  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For minima to occur,<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(i)<br /><br />and for maxima<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(ii)<br /><br />From Equations. (i) and (ii), we get<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>7500</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6500</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7500</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><mn>15000</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13000</mn><mi>n</mi></math><br /><br />or <math><mn>2000</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7500</mn></math><br /><br />or <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.75</mn></math><br /><br />Substituting the value of <math><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math> in equation (i), we get<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3.75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6500</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7.40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
